# k.attributes/shards/things-visual-genome: the usual colour of common things that the catalog lacked, from Visual Genome's object attributes: the modal basic colour of the sense's synset when its colour words are said at least 20 times and it holds at least 50 % of them. Hand check (sources/coverage/kr6-visual-genome-colour-audit.tsv): 26 of 133 checked wrong (20 %), 107 checked right published of 140. Attribution: Visual Genome (Krishna et al., 2017), CC BY 4.0.
# sources: visual-genome 1.4 (Visual Genome, Krishna et al. 2017, CC BY 4.0: object attributes aggregated, questions.md Q80)
# license: CC-BY-4.0
# script: tools/import/attributes-data.mjs

